<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111644" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλύρ-α</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ</span>], 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλύρ-ρη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lime tree, Tilia
				platyphyllos,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.12.4
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἄρρην,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλυρέα</span>
			, and 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. θήλεια</span>”
				<i>silver lime, Tilia tomentosa,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					3.10.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the bass underneath its bark,</i> used for writing on, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).630
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.17.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				72.8
			</span></i>; for garlands, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλύρας . . ἄφυλλος στέφανος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenarch.
					13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
